## Compliance preset

This profile honors **general-edition `compliance: none`** by default. To upgrade:

- **`enterprise` preset:** GDPR/SOC2 baseline → no SSN, no financial IDs, consent tracking enabled
- **`healthcare` preset:** NOT available in general-edition adapter (requires biotech-edition adapter; B7 compliance review pending)

To change compliance preset, edit `<edition>/PROFILE.md` and re-run `setup-openclaw.sh --update-profile`.

---

## What's INTENTIONALLY not stored here

Per MEMORY_PROTOCOL §7 standing rules:
- **NEVER** passwords, API keys, tokens, secrets
- **NEVER** SSN, credit card, financial account numbers
- **NEVER** PII/PHI (patient data, MRN, specimen IDs, genomic identifiers)

If you find any of the above in this file or any other memory file, treat it as a SCHEMA_quarantine event per MEMORY_PROTOCOL_EXTENDED §E3.3.

